Vectriva
Production-Grade Agentic Multimodal RAG SaaS Platform
1. Product Vision

Vectriva is a production-level SaaS platform that enables businesses to create intelligent, product-trained, agentic chatbots capable of:

Understanding product documentation

Performing multimodal RAG (text, tables, images, Excel)

Guiding customers conversationally

Recommending products

Booking appointments via Google Calendar

Automatically generating Google Meet links

Operating in a secure multi-tenant SaaS environment

Vectriva is not just a chatbot tool — it is an AI Agent Infrastructure Platform for product-centric businesses.

